# CodeAlpha_StudentGradeTracker

Java console application built as part of the **CodeAlpha Java Programming Internship**.

## 📌 About
This program lets you input marks for multiple students and instantly generates a summary report showing each student's marks along with the **average, highest, and lowest** scores in the class.

## ✨ Features
- Input any number of students with name and marks
- Stores data using `ArrayList`
- Calculates:
  - Average marks
  - Highest marks (with student name)
  - Lowest marks (with student name)
- Displays a clean, tabular summary report
- Simple console-based interface (easy to use)

## 🛠 Tech Stack
- Java (Core Java, OOP)
- Collections Framework (`ArrayList`)

## 🚀 How to Run
1. Clone this repository
   ```
   git clone https://github.com/<your-username>/CodeAlpha_StudentGradeTracker.git
   ```
2. Compile the program
   ```
   javac StudentGradeTracker.java
   ```
3. Run the program
   ```
   java StudentGradeTracker
   ```
4. Enter the number of students, then enter each student's name and marks when prompted.

## 📷 Sample Output
```
===== SUMMARY REPORT =====
Name            Marks
---------------------------
Rahul           85.00
Priya           92.00
Amit            67.00
---------------------------
Average Marks : 81.33
Highest Marks : 92.00 (Priya)
Lowest Marks  : 67.00 (Amit)
===========================
```

